AQSXcOE8ltIHoxfs5D3n_E1Qkc86sy_QOdJd9-TjxceP_w&oe=6AFF1237"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QVAojnR4MlwQ7kNvwFpvL0n&_nc_oc=Adr08MScipjjY0qnfQx3kU72Ly7ZH90cETtd5NxIo6AMUejBWFUOG9LwE3Gr71p-KQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQr8D0B8tQEEoxKDOeAwq__RwKUh6kuTz4_6NOct0Ab4A&oe=6AFF0147"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpX74m37Uk0Q7kNvwHOGOs5&_nc_oc=Adq1w868Xx6XWL3BHmyFIgz1x0ue2Zb6tpbynOhR6bDjbgPd-13kNpFTaTJgRhaJ4qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRk9tEMITVQlWaPfq1E4Ccg4oxtB51k3_IYtacvSpJVTQ&oe=6AFF2357"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z2xgOQRP2PUQ7kNvwE26MvP&_nc_oc=AdpWLzCelsu3DlL2UZFbwlumVvdUSe86k66S4gk9QgaYbgbKQrLcnU7h5l427T6uLAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDPLC1mQ6TwKqG5qwCM58I9QuJRpnmde-N6tYFncL0aQ&oe=6AFF1A4F"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NSl0gk7iPV8Q7kNvwE0v9WU&_nc_oc=AdqfMhjaF0v1ew2aIXlvqwKykiAjVc6_XGI6vjqHb8Q9eN4lThhGYYBIDs2IE3VVGas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTGHf5YxMeS_OBTnWQUad6nxev6ypIPyUx7hgPxp-2x-w&oe=6AFF23B5"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3QS1qI2aXTQQ7kNvwG20ROy&_nc_oc=Adp6h1T_bjuxKuto0uUKlGM0ITQ31x4XIh_zFAGFLrhyonPGnw4YJOJLiq7G3qXTzIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBBP-EULoCukK7fadPtD4apfefiHg-t7HoS1cy1BTAZA&oe=6AFF1D05"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca